        <p source="#source-70395-70829"><seg source="#source-70395-70515">（１）と（２）は輕くパスして、（３）は除數の十位をまづ解くことにし、（４）は左右</seg><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-70521-70569"><lem><seg source="#source-70515-70521">對稱</seg></lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-70557-70563">對象</seg></rdg></app><seg source="#source-70569-70590">なるもの同志を</seg><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-70608-70677"><lem><seg source="#source-70590-70608">掛けあはせて</seg></lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-70656-70671">掛けあせて</seg></rdg></app><seg source="#source-70677-70743">あるところが面白く、しかもその答たるや敢へて</seg><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-70749-70797"><lem><seg source="#source-70743-70749">對稱</seg></lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-70785-70791">對象</seg></rdg></app><seg source="#source-70797-70829">でないところに……。</seg></p>
